# A cooldown against the control `plain`. Three changes 10 s apart, inside
# `cooled`'s 30 s, fire it once. The pump at t=90 with nothing new fires
# neither: a cooldown suppresses, it does not defer. The change at t=150 is
# past the window and fires `cooled` again.
assert Sensor entity_id=s reading=1
pump
advance 10000000000
assert Sensor entity_id=s reading=2
pump
advance 10000000000
assert Sensor entity_id=s reading=3
pump
advance 70000000000
pump
advance 60000000000
assert Sensor entity_id=s reading=4
pump
